── SYNTAX ERROR ────────────────────────────── E0100_rust_struct.lt:1:1  [E0100]

Stilt declares a record type as `type Point = { x: i64, y: i64 }`:

  1 │ struct Point { x: i64, y: i64 }
    │ ^^^^^^

A record type is `type`, its name, `=` and its fields in braces.

To fix it, write `type … =`:

  1 │ type Point = { x: i64, y: i64 }
    │ ~~~~       ++
